{"id":4205,"date":"2024-06-03T11:16:23","date_gmt":"2024-06-03T10:16:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4205"},"modified":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","modified_gmt":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","slug":"open-call-for-ccac-young-designers-award","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/open-call-for-ccac-young-designers-award\/","title":{"rendered":"Open call for CCAC Young Designer\u2019s Award"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"660\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-1024x660.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4236 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-1024x660.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-300x193.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-768x495.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-1536x990.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-2048x1320.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-310x200.jpg 310w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/YDA-top-image-194x125.jpg 194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/660;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Are you a practising young designer working in the fields of fashion, architecture, landscape design, or urban and rural planning? Are you a good communicator? Are global sustainability and energy constraint at the heart of your work?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Calls are open for the CCAC Young Designer\u2019s Award. The co-design projects are located in London, Bristol, East Midlands, and Manchester.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can find the <a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/about\/young-designers-award\/\">application form here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are looking for young designers with practical experience to work with us on an extended co-design project in primary schools, which will run for six weeks between September 2024 \u2013 December 2025.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"660\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-1024x660.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4221 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/660;width:1161px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-1024x660.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-300x193.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-768x495.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-1536x990.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-2048x1320.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-310x200.jpg 310w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/1-IMG_0619-194x125.jpg 194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC brings top designers from diverse fields into primary classrooms to work with children on an extended co-design project. This is an opportunity to develop your skills, while conveying your knowledge and experience to enthusiastic nine and ten-year-olds.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Find out more about our programme, including <a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/schools-examples\/\">videos of previous co-design projects<\/a>. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Award is supported by The Linbury Trust.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For more information about the award, contact us at info@cc-ac.org<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>CCAC welcomes applications from people of all backgrounds<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Are you a practising young designer working in the fields of fashion, architecture, landscape design, or urban and rural planning?<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":4239,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[12],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4205","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ccac-news"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Open call for CCAC Young Designer\u2019s Award - Climate Change All Change<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/open-call-for-ccac-young-designers-award\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Open call for CCAC Young Designer\u2019s Award - Climate Change All Change\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Are you a practising young designer working in the fields of fashion, architecture, landscape design, or urban and rural planning?\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/open-call-for-ccac-young-designers-award\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Climate Change All Change\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:pu